  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あいての　あしもとに　まきびしを\nしかける。こうたいで　でてきた　あいての\nポケモンに　ダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대의 발밑에 압정을\n뿌린다. 교체된 상대\n포켓몬에게 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將撒菱散布在對手的腳下。\n讓對手替換出場的寶可夢\n受到傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur disperse des piquants sur le sol pour blesser\ntout ennemi qui entre au combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender legt Stacheln aus, die gegnerische\nPokémon verletzen, die in den Kampf gerufen\nwerden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esparce púas alrededor del equipo rival que hieren a\nlos Pokémon rivales que entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa piazza sul terreno una trappola di punte\nche danneggia i nemici quando scendono in campo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user lays a trap of spikes at the opposing\nteam’s feet. The trap hurts Pokémon that switch\ninto battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手の　足下に　まきびしを\nしかける。交代で　でてきた　相手の\nポケモンに　ダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在对手的脚下扔撒菱。\n对替换出场的\n对手的宝可梦给予伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esparce púas alrededor del equipo rival que hieren a\nlos Pokémon rivales que entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
